WEBVTT

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:02.956
we pay more attention
to the content and tone of voice.

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:09.156
AC: I think that there is definitely
something that is pure about

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.430
when all you can hear somebody's voice.

00:19:12.259 --> 00:19:14.076
Then when you switch to audio only,

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:15.815
it's like that actually is something

00:19:15.839 --> 00:19:18.411
that we're all familiar with
and are somewhat used to,

00:19:18.435 --> 00:19:20.936
and there's no sort of missing piece.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.786
AG: Plus, if you're on video all day,

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.446
you could be losing contributions

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:28.326
from one group of colleagues
in particular: introverts.

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:30.766
Why? Because of screen-out.